Z||000032||1FST2M6||03-23-2001||08:27 AM|||| <A HREF="http://www.engineered.net" TARGET=_blank>www.engineered.net</A>  e-mail Ed and he'll set you right up! It's really not that difficult to do if your even remotly mechanicly inclined... but it will take at lease a weekend per diff and the breakin period is terrible!  do figure 8s in a parking lot for at least 30min and then be nice to the car fr the first 500miles.! ||||reg||1
